SUMMARY:ASPIE Gallery Open House
DESCRIPTION:ASPIE is a non-profit organization that creates supplemental income for adult artists with disabilities. ASPIE continues serving the Lancaster community with its celebrated November Open House. Join us at the ASPIE Gallery on two Saturdays to see artwork from 30 artists with disabilities\, including 16 who are new this year. \n\n\n\n\n    learn more
