SUMMARY:2026 Greek Bazaar
DESCRIPTION:Join us for one of Lancaster’s favorite fall traditions! The 67th Annual Greek Bazaar returns with authentic Greek food\, homemade pastries\, music\, shopping\, and warm Greek hospitality. \n\n\n\nBring your family and friends and enjoy a taste of Greece right here in Lancaster! \n\n\n\nSaturday 11/7 • 10:30 AM – 6:30 PMSunday 11/8 • 11 AM – 5 PM \n\n\n\n\n    learn more
