SUMMARY:Ungala 2.0 with Music for Everyone
DESCRIPTION:Join Music for Everyone as we celebrate 20 years of music\, community\, and impact at Ungala 2.0 on at Mickey’s Black Box. This lively fundraising celebration skips the formalities in favor of great food\, live entertainment featuring G. Love & Special Sauce\, music\, fun\, and connection all in support of making music accessible to everyone. \n\n\n\nProceeds benefit MFE’s instrument grants\, repairs\, summer camps\, and in-school and after-school music programs\, helping ensure that music remains accessible to all \n\n\n\n\n    Buy tickets
