SUMMARY:Next Gen: Round Table
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the Next Gen Round Table as we partner with Mad Chef Craft Brewing and bring together four local leaders for an interactive\, small-group learning experience. Attendees will rotate between each leader in twenty-minute sessions. Every leader will follow a structured guide\, and guests will receive thoughtful questions to help spark meaningful conversation.  \n\n\n\nThis event is designed to build relationships\, share insights\, and create an approachable space to learn from leaders in our community. We also need your help! We are partnering with Community Hive to support their Food Program\, which sends food home with those in need. If you bring one of the items below to this free event\, you will receive an extra raffle ticket as a thank you for supporting the cause. Most needed items: Canned Fruit Chunky Soup Cereal Snacks Canned Meat Thank you for helping us make an impact beyond the room! \n\n\n\n\n    Register Now
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/next-gen-round-table-8/
LOCATION:Mad Chef Craft Brewing\, 2023 Miller Road\, East Petersburg\, Pennsylvania\, 17520\, United States
CATEGORIES:Community
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/09/Next-Gen-Round-Table-Nov-Meet-The-Leaders.avif
ORGANIZER;CN="Next Generation of Lancaster%2C PA":MAILTO:ej.pratt522@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
