SUMMARY:Y Impact Experience
DESCRIPTION:YMCA Impact Experience is designed to not only continue raising critical funds\, but also to raise friends and increase awareness of the many programs and services our YMCA provides. This event broadens the focus to highlight a more comprehensive approach to health and wellness\, one that reflects the diverse and growing needs of the communities we serve.\n\nJoin us for a lively evening that brings you closer to our mission! Enjoy hors d’oeuvres and drink tickets while networking with community leaders and our Y supporters before the program. Hear powerful stories and experience our impact firsthand. Enjoy music from a live DJ\, snap fun memories at the photobooth\, and bid on exciting items in our silent auction\, all while helping change lives and strengthen our community. \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Buy Tickets
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/y-impact-experience/
LOCATION:Outdoor Country Club\, 1157 Detwiler Drive\, York\, PA\, 17404\, United States
CATEGORIES:Community
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/05/Gala1.avif
ORGANIZER;CN="YMCA of the Roses":MAILTO:development@rosesymca.org
END:VEVENT
