SUMMARY:Next Gen: Women in Business
DESCRIPTION:Next Gen: Women in Business brings professionals together for networking\, leadership insights\, mentorship\, and meaningful conversation. \n\n\n\nHosted at Penn Medicine Park\, home of the Lancaster Stormers\, the event will feature a moderated panel of accomplished women leaders sharing their professional journeys\, experiences\, challenges\, and lessons learned throughout their careers. \n\n\n\nThe conversation will focus on leadership\, career growth\, mentorship\, overcoming challenges\, building meaningful relationships\, and advice for the next generation of women in business. \n\n\n\nGuests will also have the opportunity to network before and after the panel\, connect with professionals from throughout the community\, and leave with new relationships\, perspectives\, and inspiration. \n\n\n\n\n    get tickets
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/next-gen-women-in-business/
LOCATION:Penn Medicine Park\, 650 North Prince Street\, Lancaster\, Pennsylvania\, 17603\, United States
