SUMMARY:School's Out Craft Camp - November 13
DESCRIPTION:Looking for a fun and creative way to keep the kids busy when school is out? Send them to us for 3.5 hours of crafting\, games\, and fun! Each camp features hands-on craft projects\, with all materials included\, plus a snack and juice break (included with camp fee). Kids will have plenty of time to create\, play\, socialize\, and make something they’ll be excited to take home.\n\nCamps are designed for kids who love to make things and are a great way to spend a day off from school in a fun\, welcoming\, screen-free environment. Space is limited to just 8 campers\, so each child gets plenty of attention and hands-on help.\n\nCost is $55\, or $50 if you book at least 2 weeks in advance of the camp. Appropriate for ages 6+\n\nMinimum 3 kids required for each camp to run. \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Register Now
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/schools-out-craft-camp-november-13/
LOCATION:The Felted Fox\, 2029 Miller Rd.\, East Petersburg\, PA\, 17520\, United States
CATEGORIES:Education & Classes
END:VEVENT
