SUMMARY:Author Signing with Nina LaCour
DESCRIPTION:Bestselling\, award-winning author Nina LaCour is stopping by Pocket Books during her book club tour of the US following the release of her gorgeous novel Meet Me in the Garden! This will be a relatively informal event\, so there’s no ticket needed\, but we’re asking you to RSVP so that we can have a sense of how many people plan on stopping by! You’ll be able to have Nina sign your copy of her book (and snag a few more for holiday gifts\, hint hint) and chat with her a bit! \n            \n        \n                \n                \n    Register Now
