SUMMARY:Flamenco y Sol: Flamenco at Its Essence
DESCRIPTION:Flamenco y Sol\, in collaboration with Rebeca Tomas and A Palo Seco Flamenco Company\, presents an evening of traditional flamenco in its most authentic form\, featuring live music\, improvisation\, and the dynamic interplay between dancer\, singer\, and guitarist. Rooted in the tablao tradition\, the performance highlights the raw emotional power of flamenco through cante (song)\, baile (dance)\, and toque (guitar playing). Each moment unfolds organically\, offering audiences a direct and immersive experience of this living art form. Through group choreography and solo moments\, each artist’s unique voice emerges\, creating a powerful and electrifying theatrical experience.  \n\n\n\nAt 6:30 PM\, enjoy a pre-show flamenco lecture by Dr. Ana Börger-Greco Presented in partnership with the Skrodinsky Family Foundation. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n    Buy Tickets
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/flamenco-y-sol-flamenco-at-its-essence/
LOCATION:Ware Center for the Arts\, 42 N. Prince St.\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17603\, United States
CATEGORIES:Arts & Entertainment
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/10/2026.11.13-Flamenco-y-Sol.avif
ORGANIZER;CN="Millersville University Office of Visual & Performing Arts":MAILTO:cori.jackson@millersville.edu
END:VEVENT
